Modifications by Qamia (Apache-2.0 §4(b): statement of changes)
------------------------------------------------------------------------

Qamia has modified the original Cline work to produce FenneQ. Notable changes
include (non-exhaustive):

  * Rebranded the agent, its VS Code extension, persona, walkthrough, and
    user-facing UI from "Cline" to "FenneQ".
  * Replaced the model picker with the FenneQ cloud variants
    (Solar -> Opus, Aurora -> Sonnet, Comet -> Haiku).
  * Integrated FenneQ into the Qortex editor as a built-in extension and
    routed model traffic through Qamia's backend proxy (key custody,
    caching, metering, billing, routing, BYOK).
  * Connected FenneQ to the Qamia "Fenneq" MCP knowledge server.

Internal identifiers inherited from Cline (e.g. the extension id
`saoudrizwan.claude-dev`, the `cline.*` command/setting namespaces) are
deliberately retained for compatibility and are not a claim of authorship.
